## Configuration Sections

### 1. API Configuration

```json
"api": {
  "host": "0.0.0.0",
  "port": 8000,
  "debug": false,
  "workers": 1,
  "timeout": 30,
  "max_request_size": 10485760
}
```

**Parameters:**
- `host`: Host address for the API server
- `port`: Port number for the API server
- `debug`: Enable/disable debug mode
- `workers`: Number of worker processes
- `timeout`: Request timeout in seconds
- `max_request_size`: Maximum request size in bytes

### 2. Brand Configuration

```json
"brands": [
  {
    "brand_id": "example",
    "domain": "https://example.com",
    "name": "Example Trading Bot",
    "logo_url": "https://example.com/logo.png",
    "primary_color": "#10b981",
    "features": {
      "enable_real_trading": true,
      "enable_paper_trading": true,
      "max_open_trades": 20,
      "risk_percentage": 0.01
    },
    "pricing": {
      "default_currency": "USD",
      "plans": {
        "free": {"price": 0, "features": ["basic"]},
        "pro": {"price": 149, "features": ["advanced", "priority_support"]},
        "enterprise": {"price": 699, "features": ["advanced", "priority_support", "dedicated_support"]}
      }
    }
  }
]
```

**Parameters:**

#### Brand Identification
- `brand_id`: Unique brand identifier (alphanumeric with underscores or hyphens)
- `domain`: Brand domain or subdomain
- `name`: Brand display name
- `logo_url`: Brand logo URL
- `primary_color`: Primary brand color (hex code)

#### Features Configuration
- `enable_real_trading`: Enable real trading mode
- `enable_paper_trading`: Enable paper trading mode
- `max_open_trades`: Maximum number of open trades
- `risk_percentage`: Risk percentage per trade
- Additional features depend on brand configuration

#### Pricing Configuration
- `default_currency`: Default currency for pricing
- `plans`: Pricing plans with features

### 3. Application Settings

```json
"settings": {
  "environment": "production",
  "log_level": "info",
  "enable_metrics": true,
  "metrics_retention_hours": 24,
  "rate_limit_per_minute": 60,
  "max_request_size": 10485760,
  "cors_origins": ["*"],
  "enable_authentication": true,
  "jwt_secret": "your-jwt-secret",
  "jwt_expiration": 3600
}
```

**Parameters:**

#### Environment Settings
- `environment`: Application environment (development, testing, production)
- `log_level`: Logging level (debug, info, warning, error)
- `enable_metrics`: Enable/disable metrics collection
- `metrics_retention_hours`: Metrics retention period in hours

#### Performance Settings
- `rate_limit_per_minute`: Rate limit for API requests per minute
- `max_request_size`: Maximum request size in bytes
- `cors_origins`: CORS allowed origins

#### Security Settings
- `enable_authentication`: Enable/disable authentication
- `jwt_secret`: JWT secret key
- `jwt_expiration`: JWT token expiration time in seconds

